<title>POLAND: Boryszew Q1 net rises to PLN 1.2 mln.</title>
<headline>Boryszew Q1 net rises to PLN 1.2 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boryszew) preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			1.91  vs     1.53</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  1.81  vs     1.35</p>
<p>    net profit				1,22  vs     0.79</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Boryszew SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				21.40  vs    20.45</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 19.45  vs    18.97</p>
<p>    income tax				0.60  vs     0.56</p>
<p>    financial revenues		    0.31  vs     0.40</p>
<p>    financial costs			 0.40  vs     0.58</p>
<p>    investment				3.27  vs     1.07</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
